Package: harbor-ssh
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Harbor SSH contributors
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libgtk-3-0t64, libglib2.0-0t64, libsecret-1-0, xdg-utils
Recommends: gnome-keyring, xdg-desktop-portal, fonts-noto-cjk
Description: Harbor SSH workspace for SSH terminals, SFTP and port forwarding
 Harbor SSH is a cross-platform SSH workspace with terminal sessions,
 SFTP file browsing, port forwarding and AI-assisted commands.
 .
 This package installs the Flutter Linux desktop bundle under /opt/harbor-ssh
 and provides the harbor-ssh launcher and desktop entry.
